/R2I/<yyyy-MM-dd>/h3_ref2i_00001..N_.png (all 22 frames, auto-numbered, never overwritten)\n- Video:  output/R2I/<yyyy-MM-dd>/video/h3_ref2i_*.mp4 (QC only — spot blink/motion frames)\n\n**怎么改成自己的图 / Adapt it:**\n1. LoadImage 节点换成你的参考图（1-2 张最佳，越多越慢越容易身份打架）\n2. Width/Height 改成和你参考图一致的宽高比（32 的倍数，短边 ≤768 最快）——不一致可能出黑边\n3. 改 Prompt 节点（六段式语法，见下）\n4. 其他都不用动：Duration 0.9s = 22 帧候选（帧数网格 17k+5，时长自动向上取整；0.2s = 5 帧纯抽卡但画质可能下降）；Seed 想重抽就换一个；Steps 20 / beta 调度别动\n\n**Prompt 六段式速查（retention_analysis 是编辑指令核心）:**\n- subject_definitions — <Subject N> 绑定 <Picture N>，特征点清\n- summary — 一句话任务书\n- retention_analysis ★ — 保留什么 / 改什么：\n  · partially_preserved = 主力：逐项列\"保留清单\"(face, hair, eyes, pose retained exactly) + \"替换指令\"(X replaced by Y)，越具体越听话\n  · attribute_transfer = 跨角色迁移（Subject 1 = 身份来自图A，Subject 2 = 服装来自图B）\n  · 3D/动漫转真人（cosplayer 重构）：保留清单只放可穿戴件（假发/美瞳/服装），脸写 NOT retained，替换成真人\n- detailed_description — 静态镜头 + 构图锚点（\"entire body from head to toes visible, headroom above, floor space below\" 防裁切）+ 目标细节\n- overall_soundscape / non_diegetic_music — 图像任务填 N/A 即可\n\n**经验参数（3080 实测）:** 768x1024 · 22f · beta ≈ 90-150s/次；成本 ≈ 45s 固定 + ~6.5s/帧 + ~15s/参考图。完整 prompt 语法见 MiniMax 官方 VIDEO_PROMPT_WRITING_GUIDE_ref_en.md"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "[NOTE]", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [796.5639038085938, 674.5126342773438], "pos": [-2945.468017578125, 948.7892456054688], "id": 30, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 5}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [56, 70], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [575.0687866210938, 630.597412109375], "pos": [-965.8349609375, 851.8206787109375], "widgets_values"